    {
      "id": "EXP-PROJ-002",
      "title": "按落点抛射、轨迹参数与自定义更新接管",
      "aliases": [
        "ComplexProjectile:Launch",
        "ComplexProjectile:SetOnUpdate",
        "ACTIONS.TOSS",
        "落点投掷",
        "抛物线"
      ],
      "engineering_question": "如何让可投掷物沿原版抛物线到指定位置，并选择默认落地或额外飞行检测？",
      "knowledge_status": "research",
      "retrieval_status": "restricted",
      "coding_status": "hold",
      "scope": {
        "source_epoch": "762172",
        "steam_buildid": "26474873",
        "runtime_verified": false,
        "side": "服务器TOSS/Combat/weapon到complexprojectile及具名bomb/cannonball消费者。",
        "increment_over_existing": "NC-N004-FINAL-01/02已有默认Hit只调回调、Launch保存归因等事实。本条新增TOSS真实输入/拆单件、轨迹可达性与moving-platform速度继承、SetOnUpdate完整接管合同。EXP-PRES-002保留火炬声音范围。"
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "EXP-PROJ-002-C01",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "TOSS.fn从act.invobject或带special_action_toss的HANDS物品取弹体，要求complexprojectile并检查装备限制/防卸下及拟态。DropItem(item,false)后，实体target分支取其位置并把targetoffset设为y=1.5，否则取GetActionPoint，Launch(pos,doer)后返回true。已有SGwilson的TOSS handler选择throw/throw_keep_equip，普通throw时间线调用PerformBufferedAction。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "PROJ-TOSS",
            "PROJ-SGSELECT",
            "PROJ-SGTOSS"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-PROJ-002-C02",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Launch保存attacker及owningweapon（缺省弹体自身），ForceFacePoint后按launchoffset偏移初始位置，直接把传入targetPos.y改为targetoffset.y或0，再CalculateTrajectory。若发射者当前平台有Physics，旋转换算平台速度并加到本地velocity.x/z。最后onlaunchfn(projectile,attacker,targetPos)，加入activeprojectile并启动更新。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "PROJ-ARC"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-PROJ-002-C03",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "CalculateTrajectory将horizontalSpeed当作speed求发射角与velocity，usehigharc选择两解高/低角。判别式为负时使用30度回退。CalculateMinimumSpeedForDistance按gravity、launch/target高度偏移计算可达速度；SetHorizontalSpeedForDistance使用该返回或fallback。没有由Launch返回值提供可达保证。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "PROJ-PCONFIG",
            "PROJ-ARC"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-PROJ-002-C04",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "默认OnUpdate先运行onupdatefn(projectile)，truthy返回会跳过本轮motor设置、重力累积与落地检查；回调参数没有dt。默认下降且y<=0.05时Hit()，因此该落地回调的target为nil。Hit先Cancel再onhitfn(projectile,attacker,target)，Cancel清速度/更新而归因字段保留，实体最终去向由消费者处理。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "PROJ-PCONFIG",
            "PROJ-PEND"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-PROJ-002-C05",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "bomb_lunarplant在master分支配置speed/gravity/launch offset、onlaunch和onhit；onlaunch将persists设false并改为飞行物理/表现，onhit交爆炸helper。cannonball另安装file-local OnUpdateProjectile扫描飞行路径附近实体，普通路径返回nil使默认抛物线更新继续。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "PROJ-BOMBINIT",
            "PROJ-BOMBTHROWN",
            "PROJ-BOMB",
            "PROJ-CANNONUPDATE",
            "PROJ-CANNONINIT",
            "PROJ-PEND"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-PROJ-002-C06",
          "kind": "REC",
